---
source: tests/surface.rs
expression: "screen(&mut surface, 70, 45)"
---
 M src/other                                                      1/2
1 one        General
2 two        ?               Show every key
3            : C-p           Command palette
             r               Reload from git
             q C-c           Quit
             Esc             Back, or quit

             Files
             ] Tab           Next file
             [ S-Tab         Previous file
             /               Find file
             C-b f           Toggle file list
             e               Open in $EDITOR
             y               Copy path
             Y               Copy path:line or lines
             V               Select lines
             v               Mark viewed, go to next
             u               Next unviewed file

             Diff
             n               Next hunk
             N p             Previous hunk
             Enter o         Unfold, or toggle annotation
             j ↓             Down a line
             k ↑             Up a line
             C-d             Down half a page
             C-u             Up half a page
             PgDn C-f Space  Down a page
             PgUp            Up a page
             g Home          Top of the file
             G End           Bottom of the file
             H S-←           Cursor to the old side
             L S-→           Cursor to the new side
             h ←             Scroll left
             l →             Scroll right

             View
             s               Split or unified
             w               Wrap long lines
             z               Fold unchanged lines
             W               Ignore whitespace

                                           any key closes
